
currently the plugin creates temp files then compare them, cudatext have a new and better way to compare without using temp files using this, open untitled tab , set PROP_EDITORS_LINKED to False then split the tab to two frames like that:
file_open('')
ed.set_prop(PROP_EDITORS_LINKED, False)
ed.set_prop(PROP_SPLIT, ('v', 500))

then we can load the original file content or untitled tab content inside that new splited tab, this allows us to not use any temp file and simplify the code a lot much 
